part cis_2025
  tally 1
  note "Bank Cis current account LN45 2090 0017 5521 3380 0001, 2025: every row of the twelve exports. Each export is a CSV with # header lines and dd-mm-yyyy dates, which no Tally text loads (OPERATIONS §2.2 names no format: O:B-1), so the rows are written out, each citing its file and line."
  note "One covering version per month (L §5.18), known the 2nd of the next month (the export day is not stated: assumed). November covers only to 2025-11-13, where its export stops; 2025-11-14..30 is covered by a hole row. Anchors: each month-end balance the next export opens with, the last balance of December, and the balance after the last row on each B-HR2 rule day and on 2025-10-15 (the repeated row)."

